<title>USA: Sears says buys Florida appliance supplier.</title>
<headline>Sears says buys Florida appliance supplier.</headline>
<dateline>HOFFMAN ESTATES, Ill. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sears Roebuck and Co said it acquired Florida Builder Appliances, a supplier of appliances to residential and remodeling contractors in Florida.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Florida Builder is privately owned and based in Hollywood, Fla., said Sears.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
